{"name": "Rust & Dust", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twins against the World!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control two twin mice at once in this fast-paced roguelike platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between them anytime, combine their abilities, and turn positioning into a weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508260/extras/0e3697930c5a58bfa6b15cc46f68ed27.webp?t=1785340225\" width=\"16\"/></span> Single Player Coop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch instantly between twin mice and use their positions to outmaneuver enemies. <br/>The unused twin remains in the world opening up unique tactical possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"396\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508260/extras/825bf17cfa1b188fa2256fa1b289fd5d.poster.avif?t=1785340225\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508260/extras/825bf17cfa1b188fa2256fa1b289fd5d.webm?t=1785340225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508260/extras/825bf17cfa1b188fa2256fa1b289fd5d.mp4?t=1785340225\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508260/extras/0e3697930c5a58bfa6b15cc46f68ed27.webp?t=1785340225\" width=\"16\"/></span>\u00a0Turn switching into a weapon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chain attacks, escape danger, and trigger powerful effects by swapping between the twins at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the rhythm of switching to survive overwhelming fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"626\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508260/extras/d0300cdbcf087324e1d8a618addc0904.poster.avif?t=1785340225\" width=\"1136\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508260/extras/d0300cdbcf087324e1d8a618addc0904.webm?t=1785340225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508260/extras/d0300cdbcf087324e1d8a618addc0904.mp4?t=1785340225\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508260/extras/0e3697930c5a58bfa6b15cc46f68ed27.webp?t=1785340225\" width=\"16\"/></span>\u00a0Build wild synergies every run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover upgrades that transform the relationship between the twins:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">deadly energy links between them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">explosive switches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">shadow turrets and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">battlefield control abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create builds that completely change how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"472\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508260/extras/fbc2576dcf93c363387bda5b6e6dc302.poster.avif?t=1785340225\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508260/extras/fbc2576dcf93c363387bda5b6e6dc302.webm?t=1785340225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508260/extras/fbc2576dcf93c363387bda5b6e6dc302.mp4?t=1785340225\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508260/extras/0e3697930c5a58bfa6b15cc46f68ed27.webp?t=1785340225\" width=\"16\"/></span>\u00a0Fight through intense arena battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face enemies designed to pressure your movement and positioning. <br/>To survive, you\u2019ll need quick reflexes, smart positioning, and perfectly timed switches.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508260/extras/0e3697930c5a58bfa6b15cc46f68ed27.webp?t=1785340225\" width=\"16\"/></span>\u00a0Endless roguelike replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run offers new upgrades, new combinations, and new strategies to experiment with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the system, push your builds further, and see how long you can survive.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Rust & Dust is A fast-paced 2D roguelike Shooter about two twin mice fighting through a ruined world. Instantly switch between them, combine their powers, and turn positioning into a weapon. Master the chaos or be overrun!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508260/b5b6301537daf5d13857d6438559a6d9ef12003b/header.jpg?t=1785340225", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Platformer", "Shooter", "Action Roguelike", "Bullet Hell", "Side Scroller"], "developers": "TAP", "publishers": "TAP", "release_date": "December 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4508260", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "23 July 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Ok9gf9F08yQ", "first_seen": 1784757600.0, "review_rank": 245}